  "job_B9.6.2_20251003_115049": {
    "text": "Be gesetnysse Breotene o\u00f0\u00f0e Hibernia Scotta ealandes, ond heora \u00feam \u00e6rran bigengum.\n\u00d0\u00e6t se \u00e6rra Romwara casere Gagius Iulius Breotene gesohte.\n\u00d0\u00e6t se \u00e6ftera Romwara casere, Claudius haten, \u00fe\u00e6t ylce ealond gesohte; & Orcadas \u00fea ealand\n\u00d0\u00e6t Lucius Brytta cyning sende gewritu to Eleutherio \u00feam papam, bead hine cristenne beon, and\n\u00d0\u00e6t Seuerus se casere onfeng micelne d\u00e6l Breotene, & \u00feone mid dice tosceadde fram o\u00f0rum\nBe Dioclitianus rice, & \u00fe\u00e6t he cristene men w\u00e6s ehtende.\nSancte Albanus \u00ferowung & his geferena, \u00fee on \u00f0a ilcan tid for Drihtne heora blod aguton.\n\u00d0\u00e6t, \u00f0a seo ehtnysse blan, seo cyrice on Breotene hw\u00e6thwugu f\u00e6c sibbe h\u00e6fde, o\u00f0 \u00f0a tide \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Gratiano Maximus se casere w\u00e6s on Breotene acenned, & eft mid mycle weorede\n\u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Archadio Pelagius se Bryt wi\u00f0 Godes gife geleafan unrihtlice lare onfeng.\n\u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Honorio Gratianus & Constantius w\u00e6ron on Breotene acende; & se \u00e6rra w\u00e6s on\n\u00d0\u00e6t Bryttas fram Scottum & Peohtum w\u00e6ron forhergode; & hi to Rome him fultumes b\u00e6don.\n\u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Theodosio, \u00fe\u00e6s tidum Palladius se biscop w\u00e6s sended to gelyfendum Scottum on\n\u00d0\u00e6t Bryttas mid \u00fey m\u00e6rran hungre genedde \u00fea elreordian of heora gem\u00e6rum adrifan.\n& sona \u00e6fter \u00feam mycel eor\u00few\u00e6stm & firenlust & mancwealm & adla & gehrora \u00fe\u00e6re \u00f0eode w\u00e6ron\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Angel\u00f0eod w\u00e6s gela\u00f0od fram Bryttum on Breotone; & heo sona \u00e6rest heora \u00fea wi\u00f0erweardan\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Bryttas \u00e6rest on Angel\u00f0eode sige genaman; w\u00e6s Ambrosius heora heretoga Romanisc man.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Germanus se biscop mid Lupo to Breotene on scype cumende, \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6s s\u00e6s & \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00f0ara\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca \u00fea dohter \u00f0\u00e6s ealdormannes blinde onlihte; & \u00e6fter \u00feam to \u00f0am halgan Albane\n\u00d0\u00e6tte se ylca biscop for \u00f0am intingan untrumnysse feria geh\u00e6fd & \u00fea brynas \u00feara husa gebiddende\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00fea ylcan biscopas Bryttum on gefeohte godcundne fultum forgeafon; & swa ham w\u00e6ron eft\n\u00d0\u00e6t eft spryttendum \u00feam twigum \u00f0\u00e6s Pelagianiscan woles Germanus mid Seuero to Breotene eft\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Bryttas sume tide gestildon fram utgefeohte.\n& hie sylfe \u00fer\u00e6ston in ingefeohtum, & on manegum manum hi sylfe besencton.\n\u00d0\u00e6t se halga papa Gregorius Augustinum sende mid munecum Angel\u00f0eode to bodiganne Godes\n\u00d0\u00e6t Augustinus w\u00e6s cumende on Breotone \u00e6rest on Tenet \u00feam ealonde; & Cantwara cyninge\n\u00d0\u00e6t he Augustinus on Cent \u00fe\u00e6re frym\u00f0elican cyrican lif & lare w\u00e6s onhyrigende, and on cyninges\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca, biscop geworden, onbead Gregorio \u00feam papan \u00f0a \u00fee on Breotene gedon w\u00e6ron, &\n\u00de\u00e6t se ylca papa Gregorius sende Agustino pallium & maran fultum Godes word to l\u00e6ranne.\n\u00d0\u00e6t he se papa \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhte \u00feam cyninge gewrit & gyfe sende: \u00fe\u00e6tte Agustinus Cristes cyrican\n\u00d0\u00e6t Agustinus Cristes cyrican geedniwode & worhte mid \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges fultume \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhtes.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Agustinus \u00fe\u00e6t mynster \u00feara apostola Petrus & Paulus getimbrade; & be his \u00feam \u00e6restan\n\u00d0\u00e6tte \u00c6\u00f0elfri\u00f0 Nor\u00f0anhymbra cyning Scotta \u00feeode mid gefeohte ofercom, & hi of Angel\u00f0eode\nHer enda\u00f0 seo forme boc.\nHer onginne\u00f0 seo o\u00f0er boc.\nBe for\u00f0fore \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan papan Gregorius.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Agustinus Brytta biscopas for rihtgeleaffulre sibbe l\u00e6rde & monade, ge eac gedonum beforan\n\u00de\u00e6t he Agustinus Mellitum & Iustum to biscopum gehalgode: & be his for\u00f0fore.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Laurentius mid his efenbiscopum Scottas w\u00e6s manigende on \u00f0a annysse \u00f0\u00e6re halgan cyrican,\nFor\u00f0ferendum \u00feam cyningum \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhto & S\u00e6byrhto, heora \u00e6fterfyligendas w\u00e6ron deofolgylde\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Laurentius se arcebiscop w\u00e6s ge\u00feread fram \u00feam apostole Sancte Petre; Eadbaldum \u00feone\n\u00de\u00e6t Mellitus \u00e6fter Laurentio arcebiscop geworden w\u00e6s.\n\u00dea ligeas his byrnendre ceastre gebiddende adw\u00e6scte.\nBe cynedome Eadwines; & \u00fe\u00e6t cumende Paulinus him godspell bodade, & \u00e6rest his dohtor mid\n\u00d0\u00e6t se papa Bonefatius \u00feone ylcan cyning, onsendum gewritum, w\u00e6s trymmende to rihtum\nHwylc ge\u00feeaht se ylca cyning mid his ealdormonnum h\u00e6bbende w\u00e6s be \u00fe\u00e6re onfengnysse Cristes\n\u00de\u00e6t se ylca Edwine mid his \u00feeode geleafful geworden w\u00e6s; & \u00fe\u00e6t Paulinus hine gefullade.\n\u00d0\u00e6t seo m\u00e6g\u00f0e Eastengla Cristes geleafan onfeng.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Paulinus on Lindesege m\u00e6g\u00f0e bodigende w\u00e6s Cristes geleafan.\nBe \u00fe\u00e6re sibbe & stillnysse Eadwines cyninges rices.\nBe for\u00f0fore Iustus \u00fe\u00e6s arcebiscopes: & \u00fe\u00e6t Honorius for him gecoren w\u00e6s & fram Paulino on\n\u00d0\u00e6tte, ofslegenum eadwine fram pendan myrcna cyninge, paulinus se bisceop w\u00e6s eft cumende to\nHer enda\u00f0 seo o\u00f0er boc.\nAnd her onginne\u00f0 seo \u00feridde.\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00fea forman \u00e6fterfyligende Eadwines cyninges \u00feone geleafan his agenre \u00feeode besmiton: &\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca cyning biddende of Sceotta \u00feeode biscope onfeng Aidanum on naman gehatenne, &\nBe Aidanus life \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes.\nBe eauf\u00e6stnysse & wundorlicre arf\u00e6stnysse Oswaldes cyninges.\n\u00d0\u00e6t seo m\u00e6g\u00f0 Westseaxna, bodigendum Birino \u00feam biscope, onfeng Godes word; & be his\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Cantwara cyning Erconbyrht bebead deofolgyld beon toworpene : & be his dehter\n\u00d0\u00e6t on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe, \u00f0\u00e6r ofsl\u00e6gen w\u00e6s se cyning Oswald, gelomlicu wundurgeweorc gewordene\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan stowe myl wi\u00f0 fyre w\u00e6s freomigende.\n\u00d0\u00e6t ofer his reliquias \u00fe\u00e6t heofonleoht ealle niht w\u00e6s ofergestond onde & scinende; & \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6t his byrigenne an lytel cniht fram lengtenadle w\u00e6s gelacnod.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte on Hibernia sum man fram his reliquium fram dea\u00f0es li\u00f0e w\u00e6s geh\u00e6led.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte for\u00f0ferdum Paulino \u00feam biscope Ithamar for him \u00e6t Hrofeceastre biscopsetle onfeng.\n& be wundorlicre eadmodnesse Oswines \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges, se fram Oswio w\u00e6lhreowlice w\u00e6s\n\u00d0\u00e6t se biscop Aidan \u00feam scypfarendum \u00feone storm towardne fores\u00e6gde, & eac him gehalgodne\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop \u00fe\u00e6t togewehgene fyr \u00fe\u00e6re cynelican burghe gebiddende onweg gewende.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Middelengla m\u00e6g\u00f0 under Peadan Pendan suna w\u00e6s cristen geworden.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Eastseaxan \u00feone rihtan Godes geleafan, \u00f0one hi gefyrn awurpon, under Sibrihte heora cyninge,\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop Cedde onfonde fram \u00feam cyninge \u00c6\u00f0elwalde sume stowe mynster on to\n\u00d0\u00e6t Mercna m\u00e6g\u00f0, ofslegenum Pendan hyra cyninge, Cristes geleafan onfengon; & Oswio se\n\u00d0\u00e6t Ecbyrht se halga wer of Angelcynnes cynne acenned munuclif w\u00e6s l\u00e6dende on Hibernia.\n\u00d0\u00e6t, for\u00f0ferdum Tudan, Wilfri\u00f0 w\u00e6s sended on Gallia, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s gehadod fram \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhte\n& hi begen w\u00e6ron Nor\u00f0hymbrum to biscopum gehalgode.\n\u00d0\u00e6t se m\u00e6ssepreost Wigeard arcebiscop to gehadianne on Breotene to Rome w\u00e6s onsended,\n\u00d0\u00e6t Eastseaxan on \u00fea tid \u00f0\u00e6s mancwealmes to deofolgylde w\u00e6ron eft gecyrde, & eft \u00feurh \u00f0a\nHer enda\u00f0 se \u00feridde boc.\nHer onginne\u00f0 seo feor\u00f0e boc.\n\u00d0\u00e6tte for\u00f0ferdum Deusdedit \u00f0on arcebiscope, Wigheard w\u00e6s \u00feam biscophade to onfonne to Rome\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00feeodorus se arcebiscop gondferend ealle Angelcynnes cyricean mid rihtgeleaffulre\n\u00d0\u00e6t Ceadda, be \u00feam \u00f0e we \u00e6r bufan spr\u00e6con, Myrcna m\u00e6g\u00f0e w\u00e6s biscop seald: & be his life, &\n\u00d0\u00e6t Coloman se biscop, forletenre Breotone, twa mynstro on Scottum geworhte, o\u00f0er \u00feam\nBe dea\u00f0e Oswies & Ecbyrhtes \u00feara cyninga: & be \u00feam sino\u00f0e \u00fee geworden w\u00e6s \u00e6t Heortfeorda,\n\u00d0\u00e6t adune asetton of \u00feam biscoprice Winfri\u00f0e, Seaxulf his biscoprice onfeng: & Erconwold\n\u00d0\u00e6t on Berccingum \u00feam mynstre mid heofonlice leohte getacnod w\u00e6s, hw\u00e6r gesette beon\n\u00de\u00e6t on \u00feam ylcan mynstre sum lytel sweltende cniht be naman genemde \u00f0a mynsterf\u00e6mnan, \u00f0e\nHwylce heofonlicu tacnu \u00e6tywde w\u00e6ron, \u00fea \u00f0a seo modur sylf \u00f0\u00e6re gesomnunge of middanearde\n\u00d0\u00e6t Torhtgy\u00f0 seo Godes \u00feeowen \u00f0reo gear \u00e6fter \u00f0\u00e6re hl\u00e6fdian for\u00f0fore \u00fea geta on life h\u00e6fd w\u00e6s.\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6t \u00feam lictune \u00f0\u00e6s mynstres an blind wif hire w\u00e6s gebiddende ; & for\u00f0am onfeng \u00feam\n\u00d0\u00e6t se cyning \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan m\u00e6g\u00f0e Sebbe on munuclicum drohto\u00f0e his lif geendode.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Westseaxna biscophad for Eleutherio H\u00e6dde w\u00e6s onfonde, & \u00f0one \u00e6t Hrofeceastre for\n\u00d0\u00e6t se steorra \u00e6tywde, se is cometa nemned, & \u00fereo mona\u00f0 w\u00e6s wuniende, and symble on\nOn \u00feam ylcan geare Ecfri\u00f0 Nor\u00f0anhymbra cyning adr\u00e6fde Wilfir\u00f0 \u00feone arwyr\u00f0an biscop.\n\u00d0\u00e6t Willfer\u00f0 biscop Su\u00f0seaxna m\u00e6g\u00f0e to Criste gecyrde, seo hw\u00e6\u00f0ere, him \u00f0anon gewitendum,\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ealond Wiht onfeng cristene bigengan, \u00fe\u00e6s twegen cynelice cnihtas \u00e6fter \u00feon onfangenan\nBe \u00feam sino\u00f0e se w\u00e6s geworden on \u00feam felda, se w\u00e6s genemned H\u00e6\u00fefeld, andweardan \u00feam\nBe Iohanne \u00feam heahseangere \u00fe\u00e6s apostolican setles, se for lare com to Breotone.\n\u00d0\u00e6t seo cwen \u00c6\u00f0eldry\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6mne \u00feurhwunode, \u00fe\u00e6re lichama on byrigenne gewemmed beon\n\u00d0\u00e6t se biscop \u00f0eodorus betweox Ecgfer\u00f0e & \u00c6\u00f0elrede \u00feam cyningum sibbe geworhte.\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00f0a benda sumes geh\u00e6ftes tolysede w\u00e6ron, \u00feonne for him m\u00e6ssan sungene w\u00e6ron.\nBe life & for\u00f0fore Hilde \u00fe\u00e6re abbudissan.\n\u00d0\u00e6t on hire mynstre w\u00e6s sum bro\u00f0or, \u00feam godcundlice forgifen w\u00e6s seo gyfu to singanne.\nHwilc gesih\u00f0 sumum Godes were \u00e6tywde, \u00e6r \u00feam \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t mynster \u00e6t Coludes byrig mid bryne\nBe dea\u00f0e \u00feara twegea cyninga Ecfer\u00f0es & Hlo\u00f0heres.\n\u00d0\u00e6t se Drihtnes wer Cu\u00f0bryht w\u00e6s biscop geworden, & \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0a gyt on munuclicum life geseted\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca wer Cu\u00f0byrhtus on ancerlife geseted an easpring of drigre eor\u00f0an gebiddende up\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop Cu\u00febryht his for\u00fefore \u00f0a toweardan Herebyrhto \u00feam ancran fores\u00e6de.\n\u00d0\u00e6t his lichoma \u00e6fter endleofan gearum his byrigenne w\u00e6s cl\u00e6ne \u00e6lcere brosnunge funden &\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00e6t his reliquium nu niwan w\u00e6s sum man geh\u00e6led fram \u00fe\u00e6re adle his eagan.\n\u00d0\u00e6t o\u00f0er \u00e6t his byrigenne fram lyftadle w\u00e6s geh\u00e6led.\nHer enda\u00f0 seo feor\u00f0e boc.\nHer onginne\u00f0 seo fifte boc.\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00c6\u00f0elwold Sancte Cu\u00feberhtes \u00e6fterfyligend on ancersetle ond life geseted \u00feam winnendum\n\u00d0\u00e6t se biscop Iohannes \u00e6nne dumbne monn gebiddende geh\u00e6lde.\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop an adliende m\u00e6den gebiddende geh\u00e6lde.\n\u00d0\u00e6t he anes gesi\u00f0mannes wif untrum mid gehalgode w\u00e6tere gelacnode .\n\u00d0\u00e6t se ylca biscop anes gesi\u00f0mannes cniht gebiddende fram dea\u00f0e gecigde.\n\u00d0\u00e6t he his preosta \u00e6nne of horse fallende & gebrysedne gelice gebiddende & bletsigende fram\n\u00d0\u00e6t Ceadwala Westseaxna cyning to gefulliane com to Rome: swa eft his \u00e6fterfyligend Ine \u00f0a\n\u00d0\u00e6t, for\u00f0ferdum \u00deeodoro, \u00f0one arcebiscophad Beorhtwald onfeng; &, betweox o\u00f0ra monige \u00fee he\n\u00d0\u00e6t se halga wer Ecbyrht becuman wolde on Germaniam to bodianne godcunde lare.\nAc he ne mihte: ac Wihtbyrht \u00f0yder becom for him, & \u00f0\u00e6r nowiht ne fremede; & \u00fea eft w\u00e6s ham\n\u00d0\u00e6t Wilbrord on Frysena lande bodiende monega to Drihtne gecyrde : & \u00fe\u00e6t his geferan twegen\n\u00d0\u00e6t se arwur\u00f0a wer Swi\u00f0byrht on Breotone, & Wilbrord \u00e6t Rome biscopas w\u00e6ron Fresna \u00f0eode\n\u00d0\u00e6t sum on Nor\u00f0anhymbra m\u00e6g\u00f0e of dea\u00f0e arisende sume swi\u00f0e ondryslicu & eac to\n\u00d0\u00e6t ongean \u00feam o\u00f0er, to dea\u00f0e becumende, geseah him fram deoflum tobrohte beon \u00f0a boc his\n\u00d0\u00e6t eft o\u00f0er sweltende him \u00fea getealdan stowe mid helwarum his agenra wita geseah.\n\u00d0\u00e6t monega cyricean on Hibernia l\u00e6rendum Athamano \u00fea eallgeleaflican Eastran onfengon: & be\n\u00d0\u00e6tte Cynred Mercna cyning & Offa Eastseaxna cyning on munuclicum hadum to Rome becom,\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00feam eauf\u00e6stan abbude Adriano Albinus \u00e6fterfyligde: & fram \u00feam biscope Wilfri\u00f0e Acca his\n\u00d0\u00e6t se abbud Ceolfri\u00f0 Peohta cyninge, Neaton w\u00e6s haten, heahcr\u00e6f tigan somod & eac epistolam\n\u00d0\u00e6t \u00fea munecas on Hii \u00feam ealonde mid him \u00f0am under\u00feeoddum mynstrum \u00fea \u00f0a rihtgeleaffullan\nBe for\u00f0fore Tobias \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes \u00e6t Hrofesceastre & Ecgbyrhtes \u00fe\u00e6s arwur\u00fean biscopes on \u00f0one\nHwylc se sta\u00f0ol is on andweardnesse Angelcynnes \u00feeode ge eac ealre Breotone.",
